(f)
If at any point of time the child has to be institutionalised, the sponsorship shall be discontinued;

1. Duties of Superintendent:
(1)
Superintendent shall attend to the following duties:
(a)
Attending to the care and welfare requirement of children:
(b)
Convening the meetings of the Home Committees and is responsible for its effective functioning;
(c)
Proper maintenance of buildings and premises;
(d)
